       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "40146846"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Proteolytically activated within lysosomes. Undergoes autocatalytic cleavage into an N-terminal A chain and a C-terminal B chain (PubMed:40146846). Both chains A and B remain associated in the mature protein (By similarity). An additional maturation step involves the removal of a segment spanning residues Leu-209-227-Cys, which occludes the active site (PubMed:40146846)"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "PTM"
  },
  {
   "texts": [
    {
     "evidences": [
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000305"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Belongs to the Ntn hydrolase family"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "SIMILARITY"
  },
  {
   "texts": [
    {
     "evidences": [
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250",
       "source": "UniProtKB",
       "id": "Q9GL30"
