       "id": "19019078"
      },
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "40146846"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Was shown to exhibit a weak phospholipase activity, acting on various phospholipids, including phosphatidylcholine, phosphatidylinositol, phosphatidylethanolamine and lysophospholipids (in vitro) (PubMed:19019078). However, phospholipase activity is not confirmed by other authors (PubMed:40146846). Furthermore, structural feature prediction does not support the idea that LYLAP is a phospholipase (By similarity)"
    }
